>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `reset_traces`

``` hol4
HOLFlags.reset_traces : unit -> unit
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Resets all registered tracing variables to their default values.

### Failure

Fails if a `set` function associated with a "functional" trace (see
`register_ftrace`) fails.

### See also

[`HOLFlags`](#HOLFlags), [`HOLFlags.set_trace`](#HOLFlags.set_trace),
[`HOLFlags.create_trace`](#HOLFlags.create_trace),
[`HOLFlags.reset_trace`](#HOLFlags.reset_trace),
[`HOLFlags.trace`](#HOLFlags.trace),
[`HOLFlags.traces`](#HOLFlags.traces)
